  "title": "Fed Adjustments Amid Inflation Concerns",
  "summary": "The U.S. Federal Reserve faced mixed signals from recent July payrolls and job data, with weak figures providing some cover for its rate adjustments, while a disappointing job report left investors uncertain.",
